sequenceDiagram
    participant Founder as Founder (Browser)
    participant UI as Open WebUI Service
    participant Router as Agentic Router (The Mind)
    participant Senses as MCP Services (Tech/Market)
    participant Memory as pgvector (The Hippocampus)
    participant Engine as Ollama Service (RTX 5080)

    %% STEP 1: INGESTION
    Founder->>UI: Types: "Is my code YC-ready?"
    UI->>Router: POST /v1/chat/completions (Standard OpenAI API)

    %% STEP 2: PARALLEL ENRICHMENT (The Router "Reaches" out)
    Note over Router, Senses: The Mind gathers context simultaneously
    par Context Gathering
        Router->>Senses: JSON-RPC: "Get current Git audit"
        Senses-->>Router: JSON: [File diffs, architecture summary]
        Router->>Memory: SQL: "Find relevant YC Playbooks"
        Memory-->>Router: Text: [YC engineering standards]
    end

    %% STEP 3: EXECUTIVE SYNTHESIS (The "One Big Call")
    Note over Router, Engine: Router bundles Senses + Memory + User Query
    Router->>Engine: POST /api/generate (The "Mega-Prompt")
    Engine-->>Router: Raw Reasoning / Strategic Advice

    %% FINAL DELIVERY
    Router-->>UI: Final Formatted Response
    UI-->>Founder: "Here is your YC Readiness Report..."